        {
          "path": "_m/g/f/n/1/carnoustie-golf-links-wp/jean-van-de-velde-was-here-geo.jpg",
          "filename": "Jean Van de Velde was here - geograph.org.uk - 1490586.jpg",
          "caption": "Jean Van de Velde was here The Barry Burn at the 18th hole, Carnoustie.  Scene of the famous finish to the 1999 Open where Jean Van de Velde, with a 3 shot lead on the last hole, found the grandstand, the burn and sand to only end up with a play off place. He played a shot from in the burn - taking a drop would have probably won the claret jug. Sometimes the loser is better remembered.\nA few days before my visit, the burn flooded some of the town and links. Rifle fire could be heard from the army ranges, the other side of the course.",
          "alt": "Jean Van de Velde was here The Barry Burn at the 18th hole, Carnoustie.  Scene of the famous finish to the 1999 Open where Jean Van de Velde, with a 3 shot lead on the last hole, found the grandstand, the burn and sand to only end up with a play off place. He played a shot from in the burn - taking a drop would have probably won the claret jug. Sometimes the loser is better remembered.\nA few days before my visit, the burn flooded some of the town and links. Rifle fire could be heard from the army ranges, the other side of the course.",
          "width": 640,
          "height": 480,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
